{"v":4,"catch":"奪回鏡國！ ！","desc":"《MARCHEN MAZE》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1988年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制主角Alice，奪回被邪惡皇后佔領的鏡之國。\n使用肥皂泡攻擊和跳躍穿過該區域並擊敗在盡頭等待的頭目。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-02-06","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65c8f922f7324f8af6a11fe77ca324bba2177f8be9fa04a340b00043ac454ae7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae0dc6ddc3952b98f110d7303ae21703b4f419a9778b7e0cfde2deb428f27b13.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cb6b809022741751afb23ae64378d8d3c616268c7c36affe6535b25a163e448e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1db305b069b26fc2ada824affa37e73c7b515a679f27e18888edd7a405cd9ac4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0ba87ce60712a07e93541102b1a87e6adb70b74f21dd79a3d7b7f6db7b90181.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dda3253d670b7dbc5658d786cd0c9690aae4596d330847752f27d1721104eb8c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100071020c58000","dlc":[]}